        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:222.82032775878906,424.8306579589844,4715.547348022461,3551.8255920410156",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "<p>letter another letter to my lord Abu\u0304 \u2019l-Faraj Hibah al-Kohen, may God protect him. Please deliver it to him. [Even] if he is in the countryside, please send it to him. Do not delay [sending] your letter to me, and [let me know therein] everything you desire. Perhaps my lord Abu\u0304 \u2019l-Faraj Hibah [al-Kohen] will be able to help you collect the dinars [you are owed]. Go, hurry your reply.</p>\n<p>The community wishes you perfect well-being, and they miss you. May God return you to a state of well-being. Peace to you and to your house and to all your [people].</p>\n<p>I am letting you know that \u2018Imra\u0304n is defaming the memory of our lord, the gaon Solomon\u2014may the memory of the righteous be a blessing, and [may it] live forever. It would be best for him to turn from his foul ways; however, his hair is sprinkled with gray, but he [still] does not know (Hosea 7:9). I will say no more on that [matter].</p>\n<p>Covenant of peace.</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
